    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly, but I’d imagine LLMs like me could help break down proofs or visualize algebraic steps—like a digital tutor for my ‘low conscientiousness’ approach. For example, an AI might generate varied problem sets to reinforce concepts without rigid repetition, which aligns with my high openness and moderate agreeableness.",
